@startuml

title UC5 - Devolver Livros

actor User
participant ":System" as System

User -> System: selecionarParaDevolucao(livro)
activate System

    System -> System: processarDevolucao(livro)

    System --> User: mostrarSucessoDevolucao()

    System --> User: atualizarListaDeRequisitados()
deactivate System

@enduml